    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d802">

                <pb facs="0807" n="549" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg549"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/1581</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 16, 1915</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.15 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Prize-court judgment against American packing houses given today. Judgment
                    sustains orders in council and largely based [on] refusal of claimants to accept
                    burden of proof and demonstrate innocent destination.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
